      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": -344.94551523131224,
      "y": 113152.09396332974,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 1413.699951171875,
      "height": 475.19999999999993,
      "seed": 1937943920,
      "groupIds": [
        "7shzOUtFOVAgiTyS8Xm49"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790266204612,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "    ==> the problem here is :\n    ==> it doesn't check the digest\n\n    ==> and if we use the Floating tag\n        \n        what could have happened in the meantime is that \n        the developer could have pushed a new version \n        of the image to the registry\n\n    ==> in which case the version of the application at\n        the registry is different to the version that OpenShift has",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "    ==> the problem here is :\n    ==> it doesn't check the digest\n\n    ==> and if we use the Floating tag\n        \n        what could have happened in the meantime is that \n        the developer could have pushed a new version \n        of the image to the registry\n\n    ==> in which case the version of the application at\n        the registry is different to the version that OpenShift has",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "created": 1790266199986,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
